{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0037-s004", "text": "Många föreningar och organisationer erbjuder också hjälp och råd för nyanlända.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-tjanster/narration/resume-20261103T083520717076+0000-7/hb-c12-u0037-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.174965986394557, "peak": 0.289306640625, "generation_seconds": 20.163084115833044, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0038-s001", "text": "Dessutom erbjuds flerspråkig samhällsorientering.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-tjanster/narration/resume-20261103T083520717076+0000-7/hb-c12-u0038-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.597551020408163, "peak": 0.305328369140625, "generation_seconds": 15.801137834088877, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0038-s002", "text": "Tanken är att du ska delta i samhällsorienteringen på ditt modersmål eller något annat språk som du kan bra.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-tjanster/narration/resume-20261103T083520717076+0000-7/hb-c12-u0038-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 9.195102040816327, "peak": 0.287841796875, "generation_seconds": 29.987087690038607, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0038-s003", "text": "Där bekantar du dig med det finländska samhället och arbetslivet och den finländska kulturen.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-tjanster/narration/resume-20261103T083520717076+0000-7/hb-c12-u0038-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.732244897959184, "peak": 0.26959228515625, "generation_seconds": 22.902366338996217, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0038-s004", "text": "Fråga mer vid din hemkommun.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-tjanster/narration/resume-20261103T083520717076+0000-7/hb-c12-u0038-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 2.786394557823129, "peak": 0.28790283203125, "generation_seconds": 10.123745936900377, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0039-s001", "text": "Du kan studera finska och svenska även om ingen integrationsplan har utarbetats för dig.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-tjanster/narration/resume-20261103T083520717076+0000-7/hb-c12-u0039-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.732244897959184, "peak": 0.24591064453125, "generation_seconds": 26.954031426925212, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0039-s002", "text": "Kurser ordnas till exempel av medborgarinstitut, arbetarinstitut, folkhögskolor, universitet och sommaruniversitet.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-tjanster/narration/resume-20261103T083520717076+0000-7/hb-c12-u0039-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 10.379319727891156, "peak": 0.336334228515625, "generation_seconds": 34.24988642078824, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0039-s003", "text": "Om du är arbetslös arbetssökande ska du ändå komma ihåg om studierna med medarbetaren inom sysselsättningstjänsterna innan du inleder en kurs.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-tjanster/narration/resume-20261103T083520717076+0000-7/hb-c12-u0039-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 12.678095238095239, "peak": 0.44049072265625, "generation_seconds": 42.47015739697963, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
